// The feature list's selection, as Onshape's: a plain click selects that feature alone,
// Shift+click every feature from the last one clicked to this one, Ctrl+click adds or takes one
// away. Then a sketch selected in the list stays selected (its regions filled orange) when it
// is right-clicked in the view, and its menu is Onshape's sketch menu (Edit, Show dimensions,
// Show dependencies, New sketch, Offset plane, Extrude, Revolve, Hide, Section view, Export,
// Clear selection, Select, the views, Delete, appearance).
// 01 three sketches on Top (Sketch 1–3) and an extrude of the first; Sketch 1 clicked.
// 02 Shift+click Sketch 3: Sketch 1, Extrude 1, Sketch 2 and Sketch 3 selected.
// 03 a plain click on Sketch 2: only Sketch 2.
// 04 Ctrl+click Sketch 3: Sketch 2 and Sketch 3.
// 05 Sketch 3 clicked alone, then right-clicked in the view: still selected (its region
//    orange), its menu open.
// 06 the menu's Extrude…: the Extrude dialog with Sketch 3's region.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("sketch top rect 0 0 40 30"),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Wait(30),
        Key("Shift+E"),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(20, 15, 0)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("extrude-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("sketch top rect 60 0 100 30"),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("sketch top rect 0 50 40 80"),
        Wait(5),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-1")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-sketch-1-clicked"),
        KeyDown("Shift"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-3")),
        KeyUp("Shift"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-shift-click-range"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-2")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-plain-click-one"),
        KeyDown("Ctrl"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-3")),
        KeyUp("Ctrl"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-ctrl-click-adds"),
        Click(ui("feature-sketch-3")),
        Wait(10),
        RightClick(xyz(20, 65, 0)),
        WaitFor("viewport-context-menu"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("05-sketch-menu-still-selected"),
        Click(ui("viewport-extrude")),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-extrude-from-menu"),
    ],
)
